      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22079753875732422
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "The said Committee recommended that the Government may re-look into all aspects of the matter and come up with a comprehensive Bill at the earliest.",
