      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Accordingly, Ministry of Health & Family Welfare is comprehensively reviewing the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 in compliance with the directions given by this Court and also proposing to make necessary changes in the light of representations received from the Food Business Operators (FBOs).",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
