      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26636362075805664
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "From the aforesaid affidavit, it does not appear that the respondents are also proposing to make necessary amendments in the penal provisions of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 so that the punishment must be deterrent.",
